{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09904","headline":"送薛播擢第归河东 · 岑参","name":"送薛播擢第归河东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归去新战胜，盛名人共闻。\n乡连渭川树，家近条山云。\n夫子能好学，圣朝全用文。\n弟兄负世誉，词赋超人羣。\n雨气醒别酒，城阴低暮曛。\n遥知出关後，更有一终军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}